00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:34.000
2:32
Cristine: So I just did another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:40.320
podcast where we talked about how some people&nbsp;
question anything that’s not physical. Like, “Give&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:47.440
me the evidence. How do I know that there’s this&nbsp;
thing called spirit, or that there’s an essence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:56.880
like you’ve got chakras or something that you&nbsp;
can’t see?” And there’s the analogy of the wind.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:05.920
We’re talking about the weather. Can you see the&nbsp;
wind? If you look outside, can you see wind coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:12.880
by? No. You can see the effects of the wind.&nbsp;
Are the trees blowing? Is there paper coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:21.120
up from the ground? Are the clouds going faster&nbsp;
than normal? You see the effects of the wind.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:28.720
And that’s the same thing. The wind is actually&nbsp;
the spirit. The effects are the physical body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:37.749
So we see the effects of that in our body from&nbsp;
