00:27:10.480 --> 00:27:20.960
techniques with clients. When you’re working with&nbsp;
the vital body, it’s like a bridge between the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:20.960 --> 00:27:33.920
physical body and the quantum body. It’s denser&nbsp;
than the quantum, but higher / other-dimensional&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:33.920 --> 00:27:35.040
than the physical.
27:35&nbsp;

00:27:35.040 --> 00:27:42.400
Jacob: And you have success… obviously it’s very&nbsp;
