heard you talk about tapping and EMDR. Do you use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:51.280 --> 00:27:56.320
various different types of psychological&nbsp;
treatments to feed into your intuition of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:56.320 --> 00:27:57.440
what needs to happen next?
27:57&nbsp;

00:27:57.440 --> 00:28:03.040
Cristine: Yes. EFT is the tapping technique —&nbsp;
