00:28:04.240 --> 00:28:11.760
2002–2003 when Gary Craig was actually doing his&nbsp;
program. I went through all of his basic and all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:11.760 --> 00:28:18.240
of his advanced. I loved it. I was in a career at&nbsp;
