00:28:24.480 --> 00:28:34.400
As I was using that, I started developing very&nbsp;
unique adaptations. Then with my training with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:34.400 --> 00:28:40.480
Quantum University, I brought in accessing&nbsp;
