00:28:40.480 --> 00:28:48.400
at the quantum level. So it became Zero Point&nbsp;
Meridian — that’s what it’s called now, ZPM. Yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:48.400 --> 00:28:54.080
I absolutely use that. In the case I described,&nbsp;
